BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NW5 - Excellent Nosework (Amanda Lewis)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260908T170000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260908T180000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260905T155742Z
UID:1788886800_NW5-ExcellentNosework@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:The Intermediate class of Nosework incorporates the use of all
  the different oils  We will start to build search areas to mock Advanced
  trial-like setting of Interior\, Exterior\, Vehicles as well as continue 
 working on containers.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NW3 -  Novice Nosework (Amanda Lewis)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260908T183000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260908T193000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260905T155742Z
UID:1788892200_NW3-NoviceNosework@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:In the Novice class of Nosework we add all of the oils into ou
 r cocktail so that your dog can start to discriminate between the differen
 t oils. We will start to build our search areas to mock Novice trial-like 
 settings. We will start to discuss rules and regulations of AKC\, UKC and 
 other organizations.
END:VEVENT
