SUMMARY:NW2 - Beginner Nosework (Amanda Lewis)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260908T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260908T210000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260905T155742Z
UID:1788897600_NW2-BeginnerNosework@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Novice Nose Work class will introduce more games and elements 
 of Scentwork searches such as\; containers\, interiors\, exteriors\, burie
 d\, vehicles and handler discrimination.  This class progresses from Intr
 o to Nosework which must be completed prior to this class.
