BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Specialty - Sports Sampler (Lea Pfeiffer)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260909T230000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260909T235500Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260905T155744Z
UID:1788994800_Specialty-SportsSampler@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in dog sports but overwhelmed by the option
 s? This four-week class is a short introduction to tricks\, nosework\, agi
 lity\, and rally! We'll spend one week on the foundation skills for each s
 port so you can get a better idea of where your dog will really shine!
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Agility - Masters/International Level (Beth Martin)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260910T000500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260910T010500Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260905T155744Z
UID:1788998700_Agility-Masters/InternationalLevel@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Must have successfully completed Agility Open or have instruct
 or approval
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Puppy Kindergarten (Lea Pfeiffer)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260910T000500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260910T010000Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260905T155744Z
UID:1788998700_PuppyKindergarten@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:If you recently added a new puppy to your family\, you're in t
 he right place! Puppy Kindergarten is the perfect place to start for puppi
 es between the age of 2 and 5 months. We'll cover everything from teaching
  your puppy his name to the manners he'll need to be a great member of you
 r household. We'll also address unwanted behaviors like chewing\, jumping\
 , and pulling on the leash. Last but not least\, we'll help you socialize 
 your puppy to strange noises\, objects\, and surfaces!
END:VEVENT
