BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Agility - Beginner 2 (Susan Waits)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260922T011500Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260922T021500Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260905T155802Z
UID:1790039700_Agility-Beginner2@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Agility  - Your dog has learned some of the basic equipment a
 nd now your ready to learn some of the bigger obstacles\; dog walk\, tripl
 e jump\, teeter\, broad jump.  The trainer will work with you on handlin
 g skills like front and rear crosses to help you and your dog run as a tea
 m.\nPrerequisite Note:\nYour dog must be able to successfully complete all
  obstacles from Agility 1 including\; tunnel\, jump\, tire\, table.\nYour 
 dog must not be aggressive or highly reactive to other dogs or to people t
 o attend this class. If you are not sure or feel your dog might not be con
 fident enough to attend this class\, please call to speak with an instruct
 or that can help direct you into the correct class.
END:VEVENT
