UID:1790523000_TrickDog4-Perfomer@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Tricks Performer Class\nThe AKC Trick Dog Performer (TKP) titl
 e requires a dog to have the Advanced title and then perform at least 10 t
 ricks\, with at least 3 of those tricks using props. At least 3 of the tri
 cks must be from the Performer level\, and the remaining tricks can be fro
 m Performer\, Advanced\, or Intermediate levels\, but they cannot be trick
 s previously submitted for other titles.
END:VEVENT
