UID:1791046800_Orientation@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Orientation is a mini-class to cover requirements and check th
 at your dog will be a good fit for Basic Manners. Our manners classes typi
 cally fill 1-3 weeks before they start\, so you may want to register for c
 lass in advance!\nAfter reserving your spot\, you'll receive a confirmatio
 n email with instructions for orientation. Please be sure you're opted in 
 for reminder emails and we look forward to seeing you soon!
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Manners 3 - Advanced (Rachel Simmons)
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261003T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261003T185500Z
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260905T155820Z
UID:1791050400_Manners3-Advanced@luckydog
DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your dog’s training to the next level? In Adva
 nced Manners\, we build on your basic foundation to add distractions\, lea
 ve treats behind\, and introduce some tricks to keep it interesting! This 
 class is designed to take your dog’s behavior above and beyond to make s
 ure he can keep his brain in any situation. If you want to get into therap
 y work\, dog sports\, or just want your best friend to go out and about wi
 th you\, Advanced Manners is the place to be!
END:VEVENT
